@startuml
title Borehole ML Project - Quality Control Process

start

:Start quality monitoring;
:Run automated test suite;
:Record test failures;
:Calculate failure rate;
:Compare against quality threshold;

if (Within acceptable limits?) then (Yes)
  :Continue monitoring;
else (No)
  :Investigate abnormal results;
  :Identify root cause;
  :Fix defects;
  :Run tests again;
endif

:Record results in QA log;
stop

@enduml
